{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is currently still in active development so features, and levels may change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The demo only features 10 out of 30 levels planned, and a subset of the 50 anomalies that will appear in the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a reporter sent to investigate the office of a space agency after receiving words that all of its employees had mysteriously vanished. Upon entering, you find yourself in and endless loop. Strange anomalies began to appear, and you must capture them using your camera.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Observation Horror -\u00a0</strong>You may have entered what seemed like the same level, but how can you be sure that everything's the same?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/anomaly_server_room.gif?t=1749185420\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/normal_server_room.gif?t=1749185420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Camera-Based Interactions -\u00a0</strong>Your camera isn't for capturing the scenery. Capturing anomalies is your only way to directly interact with them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/normal_hallway.gif?t=1749185420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/anomaly_hallway.gif?t=1749185420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Review your photos -\u00a0</strong>Can't remember everything? You can look through what you have taken but be warned, your camera has limited storage. Use your camera sparingly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/photo-album.png?t=1749185420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mystery</strong> - Uncover the truth behind the disappearance of the employees</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/extras/demo_end_footage.gif?t=1749185420\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3666670?t=1749185420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/8d106816e677725ebd2427c8a66db8a1bf14aa75/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749185420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/5c6a63de4490c12cfa6d20d3df8c6614ff693ee1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749185420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3666670/5c6a63de4490c12cfa6d20d3df8c6614ff693ee1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749185420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3788620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The game is currently still in active development so features, and levels may change.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The demo only features 10 out of 30 levels planned, and a subset of the 50 anomalies that will appear in the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a reporter sent to investigate the office of a space agency after receiving words that all of its employees had mysteriously 